      "reasons": [
        "The packet discusses “static dispersion patterns” and notes that dispersion entropy is defined from the probability distribution of these static patterns while explicitly ignoring dynamic transitions; the definition’s phrasing that dispersion (as a term) is used for “spread and transitions of patterns over time” is not supported by the packet.",
        "The definition claims this usage “can reveal changing or chaotic behavior,” which is only supported in the packet specifically by dispersion entropy/transfer dispersion entropy for detecting chaotic features and capturing chaotic changes; the packet does not establish that this is the general meaning of “dispersion” itself.",
